                        <Text>

---

Modifiers (append after wanted amount):
'A' - Assemble only
'D' - Disassemble only
'P' - Priority (always craft first)
'H' - Hide (manage in custom data)
'I' - Ignore (don't manage and hide)
'Y#' - Yield modifier. Set # to the itemamount, one craft yields</Text>
